  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0126","idiomatic","If offering prayers at the place of campaign, a double enclosure is made and the Yellow Thearch is sacrificed on bear skins.","If offering prayers at the place of campaign, a double enclosure is made and sacrifice is offered to the Yellow Thearch on bear skins.","s0126 以熊席祀軒轅氏 means offering sacrifice to Xuanyuan/the Yellow Thearch on bear skins; the passive ‘is sacrificed’ wrongly makes him the victim, and the proposed wording restores the recipient sense without inventing content.","high","applied"],
    ["s0126","literal","If offering prayers at the place of campaign, a double enclosure is made and the Yellow Thearch is sacrificed on bear skins.","If offering prayers at the place of campaign, a double enclosure is made and sacrifice is offered to the Yellow Thearch on bear skins.","Same as the idiomatic field: 祀軒轅氏 is sacrifice to the Yellow Thearch, not of him; the literal repair matches that agent–patient relation.","high","applied"],
    ["s0283","idiomatic","The commandant kneels and places the quiver before the couch, slightly east.","The Imperial Ox lieutenant kneels and places the quiver before the couch, slightly east.","s0282 names 千牛郎將 among those who advance; bare 郎將 in s0283 continues that officer, so ‘commandant’ loses the referent and ‘Imperial Ox lieutenant’ restores it.","high","applied"],
    ["s0283","literal","The commandant kneels and places the quiver before the couch, slightly east.","The Imperial Ox lieutenant kneels and places the quiver before the couch, slightly east.","Literal field has the same continuity error: 郎將 resumes 千牛郎將 from the preceding unit, not a generic commandant.","high","applied"],
    ["s0314","literal","All twice bow.","All bow twice.","俱再拜 means all bow twice; ‘All twice bow’ is ungrammatical English for that ritual action, and the proposed order matches the Chinese.","high","applied"],
    ["s0319","literal","The Director of Audience leads kings, dukes, and those below and the attendant archers; all in the courtyard face north in pairs as head, twice bow, then are led out.","The Director of Audience leads kings, dukes, and those below and the attendant archers; all in the courtyard face north in pairs as head, bow twice, then are led out.","再拜 is bow twice; ‘twice bow’ is the same unnatural inversion fixed in s0314, and the replacement is otherwise faithful to the sentence.","medium","applied"],
    ["s0337","idiomatic","one bow, four times arrows next.","one bow and four arrows next.","弓一、矢四次之 lists one bow and four arrows next; ‘four times arrows’ misreads 矢四 as a frequency instead of a count.","high","applied"],
    ["s0337","literal","one bow, four times arrows next.","one bow and four arrows next.","Same numeral error in the literal field: 矢四 is four arrows following, not arrows done four times.","high","applied"],
    ["s0369","idiomatic","When they have gone out, the chief butcher and abstinence attendants dismember the victim's chest and dismember it west of the spirit mat, spread a mat, head to the north.","When they have gone out, the chief butcher and abstinence attendants split open the sacrificial animal's chest and dismember it west of the spirit mat, spread a mat, head to the north.","疈牲匈磔之 is split open the victim’s chest then dismember it; the doubled ‘dismember’ collapses 疈 and 磔, and the proposed wording restores both actions.","high","applied"],
    ["s0369","literal","When they have gone out, the chief butcher and abstinence attendants dismember the victim's chest and dismember it west of the spirit mat, spread a mat, head to the north.","When they have gone out, the chief butcher and abstinence attendants split open the sacrificial animal's chest and dismember it west of the spirit mat, spread a mat, head to the north.","Literal field repeats the fused 疈/磔 reading; splitting open the chest then dismembering west of the spirit mat matches the Chinese sequence.","high","applied"]
  ],
